{"version":1,"content":"<p>圍繞《GTA6》製作規模的新傳聞正在社交平台傳播。相關説法稱，本作故事戰役結束後的片尾字幕可能超過80分鐘，參與開發的人員則可能超過4000人，但這些數字尚未獲得R星確認。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1585484.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.606112+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T12:30:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"05e348c86667e1ede1f795c9aeca182c66111faa7b3c62f93eecc69f9b7fa712","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}